          {
            "title": "Filtering",
            "id": 89386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare le list comprehension per creare una nuova lista filtrando gli elementi di una lista esistente, ad esempio creando una lista di <code>high_scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>high_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare le list comprehension per creare un nuovo elenco filtrando gli elementi di uno esistente.</p><p>Un controllo <code>if</code> dopo il ciclo mantiene solo gli elementi che rendono vera la sua condizione.</p><p>Crea <code>high_scores</code>, mantenendo solo i punteggi maggiori di <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score &gt;= 30\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score &lt; 20\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>high_scores</code>, seguito da <code>score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 89387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Iniziamo come al solito con un ciclo <code>for</code> per scorrere ogni elemento della lista originale, ad esempio ogni <code>score in scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>score</code> e poi <code>in</code>, <code>scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inizia questa comprehension eseguendo un ciclo su ogni <code>score</code> in <code>scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>score</code>, <code>in</code> e infine <code>scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Expression",
            "id": 89388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per copiare ogni elemento <code>score</code> nella nuova lista, scriviamo <code>score</code> come espressione, senza applicare alcuna operazione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[12, 47, 30, 29, 19, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Condition",
            "id": 89389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per filtrare gli elementi che soddisfano una determinata condizione, aggiungiamo un'istruzione if, come qui, dove copiamo solo il punteggio <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"89\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>if score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Process",
            "id": 89390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo creato la lista in <code>high_scores</code> scorrendo ogni <code>score</code> in <code>scores</code> e copiando <code>score</code> solo se è maggiore di 20.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>high_scores</code>, seguito da <code>score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scorri ogni <code>score</code> in <code>scores</code> e copia <code>score</code> solo quando è maggiore di <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"47\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"high_scores = [score \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(high_scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score &gt; 29\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[47, 30, 29, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score</code>, seguito da <code>score &gt; 20</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
