          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 89686,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi al nuovo elenco solo i siti web francesi, scrivendo un'istruzione <code>if</code> che controlli se <code>website</code> contiene <code>\".fr\"</code> esattamente una volta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"websites = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;nytimes.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemonde.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;economist.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"french = [website \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" websites \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(french)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"127\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemonde.fr']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>, seguito da <code>website.count(\".fr\")</code> e infine <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>count()</code> per contare le occorrenze. Mantieni i siti web in cui <code>\".fr\"</code> compare esattamente una volta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"websites = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;nytimes.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemonde.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;economist.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"french = [website \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" websites \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" website.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;.fr&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(french)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"127\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"website.count(&quot;.com&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemonde.fr']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>, seguito da <code>website.count(\".fr\")</code> e infine <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Process",
            "id": 89687,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la condizione in modo che nella nuova lista vengano copiati solo i valori compresi tra <code>30</code> e <code>50</code>, estremi inclusi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"humidity_percent = [\" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ideal = [level \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" humidity_percent \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"and\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &lt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ideal)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"level == 30\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[40, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>and</code>, seguito da <code>level &lt;= 50</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mantieni i valori da <code>30</code> a <code>50</code> inclusi. Inserisci per primo il controllo del limite inferiore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"humidity_percent = [\" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ideal = [level \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" humidity_percent \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"and\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &lt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ideal)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"or\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"level == 30\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[40, 35]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>level &gt;= 30</code>, seguito da <code>and</code> e infine <code>level &lt;= 50</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
